    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like the house is structurally broken. i'm so tired of trying to fix the wiring or find more candles. what if the darkness is actually just... calmer? what if the point is to just let the lights go out instead of fighting to stay in a house that's already empty?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
