      "content": "The darkness you are trying to escape is likely the physical and emotional toll of severe depression and trauma, and choosing to stay alive is the only way to heal this broken interior space. You have the strength to endure the pain just long enough to get professional help who can safely install new lighting for you and others who care. This struggle is not a final sentence but a difficult chapter that does not have to end without a future filled with warmth and purpose.",
