      "content": "While there is a certain finality in choosing to stop, your life holds a unique potential for healing that only comes from continuing to seek professional support and treatment. Doctors can help rebuild the damaged parts of your brain so you no longer feel like a shell, offering a future free of this crushing heaviness. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line immediately; they are trained to listen without judgment and will help you find a path forward that respects your dignity. You deserve a chance to live for something other than just enduring the weight.",
